cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "emotion-algebra"
abstract: >-
  Signed integer arithmetic over a 4-axis affective space, grounding Plutchik's
  Wheel of Emotions, Cambria's Hourglass of Emotions, Scherer's Component Process
  Model and Lövheim's monoamine cube in a single typed, machine-checked algebra.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/TigreGotico/emotion-algebra"
authors:
  - given-names: Casimiro
    family-names: Ferreira
    email: jarbasai@mailfence.com
    alias: JarbasAi
keywords:
  - affective-computing
  - emotion
  - sentiment-analysis
  - plutchik
  - hourglass-of-emotions
  - appraisal-theory
